---
---

<section class="ancestro-world">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">Beyond Energy</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Ancestro Is a World — <span class="highlight">Not Just a Company</span></h2>

    <p class="section-intro">
      Ancestro extends beyond energy. Every participant in the ecosystem — customer, partner, or investor — is invited into a broader regenerative lifestyle framework.
    </p>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Internal Social Platform</h3>
        <p>For learning and connection across the global community</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Ancestral Health Education</h3>
        <p>Longevity practices rooted in ancestral wisdom</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
            <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Consciousness Practices</h3>
        <p>Spiritual and consciousness-expanding experiences</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/>
            <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Eco-Resorts Access</h3>
        <p>Ancestro-owned and affiliate regenerative retreats</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Rituals & Gatherings</h3>
        <p>Community experiences and ceremonies worldwide</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tribe-pillars">
      <h3>Ancestro is a modern tribe built on:</h3>
      <div class="pillars">
        <span class="pillar">Energy Independence</span>
        <span class="pillar-sep">&middot;</span>
        <span class="pillar">Personal Sovereignty</span>
        <span class="pillar-sep">&middot;</span>
        <span class="pillar">Health, Purpose & Awakening</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="closing">Many who enter Ancestro do not leave unchanged.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ancestro-world {
    padding: 100px 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(248,176,59,0.03) 50%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-white);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .section-intro {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 60px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(248,176,59,0.2);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(248,176,59,0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .tribe-pillars {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .tribe-pillars h3 {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .pillars {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .pillar {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .pillar-sep {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .closing {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    text-align: center;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ancestro-world {
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) and (max-width: 1024px) {
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
